  "strings": [
    "Trusting his army had destroyed Théoden's people at Helm's Deep,\u0000",
    "Saruman believed himself secure in his Tower of Orthanc.\u0000",
    "But the ringed walls of Isengard proved no defense\u0000",
    "against the vengeance of Ents and Men.\u0000",
    "And within Saruman's pits\u0000",
    "many wrathful Rohan prisoners awaited liberation.\u0000",
    "While his machineries belch foul vapors...\u0000",
    "above Saruman directs his defense and marshals his sorcery.\u0000",
    "For the battle is far from certain...\u0000",
    "and now Ent and Rohirrim alike must face Saruman's wrath.\u0000"
  ]
